{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（23日）早上9時44分，中環皇后大道中華人行滙豐銀行的職員報案，指有人試圖存入巨額鈔票。由於金額龐大，銀行職員認為有可疑，隨即報警。</p><p>警員接報到場，經初步調查拘捕兩名中年男女涉嫌行使虛假文書；有關鈔票的詳情有待進一步了解。</p><figure><img alt=\"一男一女被捕帶署。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146060685872992256095736.jpeg/NOIRWQJjGcC5ML7I6_PR7Nht7-C8zWrO-xhGNfsYRjU\"/><figcaption>一男一女被捕帶署。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一男一女被捕帶署。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146060688930770944395264.jpeg/GoE9GkgBN5gWPBwT6j1SZPtdNa5GT1NnL6lvVC-pb1Q\"/><figcaption>一男一女被捕帶署。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是華人行地下滙豐銀行。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146039721365868544168027.jpeg/5vQCJtf6jU8GaxBBhU7w-5QsnzAwfMDjnikyAp4pMgI\"/><figcaption>現場是華人行地下滙豐銀行。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146040275437621248460297.jpeg/_cp1zVuYSBucvU1o4zsf5lO68ebX6fXeIxFLOCMRSzg\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146040279577530368074931.jpeg/pyv2tbnE88I--uc36Y1ApEXXzTAT_ZadBl1FIAZdRSA\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-23T04:20:12.013646+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}